{"id": "85930", "name": "סדרה הנדסית – סכום n האיברים הראשונים (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>What is the sum of the first {{CT:0}} terms of the geometric progression</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:1}} + {{CT:2}} + {{CT:3}} + {{CT:4}} + \\ldots \\]</p><p>?</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Use the formula for the partial sum of a geometric progression, then substitute the first term and the common ratio.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The partial sum formula</b><br>The partial sum \\(S_{n}\\) of the first \\(n\\) terms of a geometric progression, first term \\(a\\) and common ratio \\(r\\), is given by the equation<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ S_{n}=\\frac{a(1-r^n)}{1 - r}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Substituting</b><br>Here \\(a = {{CT:5}}\\) and \\(r = {{CT:6}}\\) so<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ S_{{CT:7}} = {{CT:8}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "*, +", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "sum1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "SEQ-SGM-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "SEQ-SGM-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "aval/rp1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "WRONG_DENOMINATOR", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p>The partial sum of the first \\(n\\) terms of a geometric progression, first term \\(a\\) and common ratio \\(r\\), is</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{a(1-r^n)}{1-r}. \\]</p><p>Here \\(a = {{CT:5}}\\) and \\(r = {{CT:6}}\\). Your answer is</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{a}{1+r}. \\]</p></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "SEQ-SGM-1-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "NumAbsolute", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "avalrval/rp1", "testoptions": "0", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 